# Line-ending contract for this repo.
#
# The workspace scripts (.claude/refresh-commands.sh) and the brains mounted
# under brains/ are parsed byte-wise by bash, so every text file must check out
# with LF endings on every platform, regardless of the local core.autocrlf
# setting. Without this file, Git for Windows' default autocrlf=true produces
# CRLF checkouts that break bash ("$'\r': command not found").
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
